# Day 10 - AI-Powered Personal Portfolio Website

## Overview

Today I explored how AI can accelerate personal branding and web development by creating a modern portfolio website.

The goal was to design a professional, recruiter-friendly portfolio that showcases skills, projects, experience, achievements, and contact information in a clean and interactive format.

---

## Project Objective

Build a complete personal portfolio website that:

* Highlights technical skills
* Showcases projects and achievements
* Supports recruiter-friendly navigation
* Strengthens personal branding
* Provides a professional online presence

---

