## Featured Projects

### RAG-Based AI Document Q&A System

Built a Retrieval-Augmented Generation (RAG) application that allows users to upload documents and retrieve contextual answers using semantic search.

**Tech Stack:**
Python, FastAPI, Streamlit, LangChain, HuggingFace Embeddings, FAISS

---

### Attendance Management System

Automated attendance tracking platform with real-time record maintenance and reporting capabilities.

**Tech Stack:**
Python, Django, SQLite3, HTML, CSS, Bootstrap

---

### Dix.AI

AI-powered productivity assistant for meeting notes, task management, and workflow automation.

**Tech Stack:**
Python, FastAPI, OpenAI API, PostgreSQL, React, Streamlit, Docker

